// SQL-style prefix keywords on scalars and arrays
>> sum 5
>> avg 5
>> min 5
>> max 5
>> count 5
>> distinct 5

>> sum 7.5
>> count true
>> count void
>> sum void
>> avg void
>> min void
>> max void

// aggregates over an array
nums: 1, 2, 3, 4
>> sum nums
>> avg nums
>> min nums
>> max nums
>> count nums
>> distinct nums

// array of non-numbers: aggregates are void, count still counts
words: 'a', 'b', 'c'
>> count words
>> sum words